# ACCEPTANCE.md G1.3, on screen rather than in the model.
#
# Split, shrink to 80x24 so the solver has to demote, then grow back. The
# recorded screen is the one AFTER returning to 120x40, so it is the same
# screen a plain `--geometry 120x40` run of this script would produce --
# which is exactly the claim: a resize round trip restores the layout, it
# does not merely leave a valid one.

C-x 3
C-x 2
resize 80x24
resize 120x40
